### Loc for the pneumatic cannon.

pneumatic-cannon-component-itemslot-name = 气瓶

## Shown when trying to fire, but no gas

pneumatic-cannon-component-fire-no-gas = { CAPITALIZE(THE($cannon)) }咔哒作响，但没有气体喷出。

## Shown when changing power.

pneumatic-cannon-component-change-power = { $power ->
    [High] 你将限制器设为最大功率。感觉有点太强了……
    [Medium] 你将限制器设为中等功率。
    *[Low] 你将限制器设为低功率。
}

## Shown when being stunned by having the power too high.

pneumatic-cannon-component-power-stun = { THE($cannon) }的纯粹力量将你击倒！